OL,3,GNEWSAWorks begins on new #12m urgent
OL,4,Atreatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction has begun on a new #12m
OL,7,FUrgent Treatment Centre (UTC) which
OL,8,Fhealth chiefs hope will reduce wait
OL,9,Ftimes in A&E.
OL,11,FScheduled to open in December at the
OL,12,FRoyal United Hospitals Bath (RUH),
OL,13,Fhealth bosses have said the centre will
OL,14,Foffer better experiences for patients
OL,15,Fwith non-threatening illnesses and
OL,16,Finjuries.
OL,18,FOnce completed, the new centre will
OL,19,Freplace the RUH's current UTC, which is
OL,20,Fbased within A&E.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
