OL,3,GNEWSAWorks begins on new #12m urgent
OL,4,Atreatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Palmer, RUH managing director,
OL,7,Fsaid: "The start of construction work
OL,8,Fmarks a major milestone in our plans to
OL,9,Ffurther improve urgent and emergency
OL,10,Fcare services for our patients."
